<p>Portal: <a href="https://customers-dev.abtcustomer.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://customers-dev.abtcustomer.com</a>; API: <a href="https://dapi.abtcustomer.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://dapi.abtcustomer.com/</a> <a href="https://sfulham.github.io/blog/mywayplus-vulnerabilities#user-content-fnref-1-b1a85a" data-footnote-backref="" aria-label="Back to reference 1" class="data-footnote-backref">↩</a> <a href="https://sfulham.github.io/blog/mywayplus-vulnerabilities#user-content-fnref-1-b1a85a-2" data-footnote-backref="" aria-label="Back to reference 1-2" class="data-footnote-backref">↩<sup>2</sup></a> <a href="https://sfulham.github.io/blog/mywayplus-vulnerabilities#user-content-fnref-1-b1a85a-3" data-footnote-backref="" aria-label="Back to reference 1-3" class="data-footnote-backref">↩<sup>3</sup></a></p>
